# Cursor setup (Core2)

## MCP servers (`.cursor/mcp.json`)

| Server | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `linear` | Official Linear MCP (`https://mcp.linear.app/mcp`) — issues, projects, teams |
| `nlt-build` | Score, gate, quick_check, validate_changed, security, lookup_docs |
| `nlt-memory` | Session notes + brain bridge helpers |
| `nlt-setup` | Doctor, init, engagement |
| `nlt-linear-issues` | Issue/epic generators + validators — required for the `linear-issue` skill |
| `nlt-project-docs` | Docs generators / validators |
| `nlt-release-ship` | Release update flow |

Local NLT servers use the shared HTTP fleet on `127.0.0.1:8760-8765` with `X-Tapps-Project-Root` set to this workspace.

## Linear connect (once)

1. Enable the `linear` server in **Settings → Tools & MCP**
2. Complete browser OAuth when prompted
3. Verify: `list_teams` → `TappsCodingAgents`; project → `Core2`

## Reload after config changes

**Ctrl+Shift+P → Developer: Reload Window** after editing `.cursor/mcp.json` or `.tapps-mcp.yaml`.
